    ['Balamor'] = { type = 'Cutscene NPC', zones = { 'Cutscene' }, note = 'Starts Quests:\n* Sinister Reign\n\nInvolved in Quests:\n* A Thirst Before Time\n\nInvolved in Missions:\n* An Emergency Convocation\n* Arciela\'s Resolve\n* Balamor\'s Ruse\n* The Charlatan\n* Returning to the Trees\n* The Light Within\n* Where Divinities Collide\n* Visions of Dread\n* The Decisive Heroine\n* Eddies of Despair (Chapter 2)\n* Pretender to the Throne\n\nNotes:\n* Invented Otherwordly Skirmishes and Skirmish Simulacra as a passing fancy. *Creator of Rala Waterways (U), Cirdas Caverns (U), Yorcia Weald (U), and Outer Ra\'Kaznar (U). *Possessed Fremilla for a time. *Possesses Malobra at the conclusion of the story.' },
