    ['Despachiaire'] = { type = 'Quest Giver NPC', zones = { 'Tavnazian Safehold' }, location = '(K-10) of the top floor of Tavnazian Safehold (He\'s behind the Walnut Door at K-9)', note = 'Starts Quests:\n* X Marks the Spot\n* Elderly Pursuits\n* Tango with a Tracker\n* Requiem of Sin\n\nInvolved in Quests:\n* Secrets of Ovens Lost\n\nInvolved in Missions:\n* Promathia Mission 2-2: The Lost City\n* Promathia Mission 2-4: An Eternal Melody\n* Promathia Mission 4-1: Sheltering Doubt\n* Promathia Mission 4-2: The Savage\n* Promathia Mission 4-4: Slanderous Utterings\n* Promathia Mission 5-3: Three Paths\n* Past Sins (Louverance Path)\n* Promathia Mission 7-1: Chains and Bonds\n\nNotes:\nDespachiaire is an elder of Tavnazia who has helped unify the survivors of the Safehold. A devout follower of Altana, he was once employed as a trader for the church. He was the subject of secret affection of Rouva before the war. After marrying one of the cathedral theologians and moving back to Tavnazia, Despachiaire\'s son was lost in the war, making his granddaughter, Ulmia, the sole recipient of his doting affection.' },
