    ['Halver'] = { type = 'Quest Giver NPC', zones = { 'Chateau d\'Oraguille', 'San d\'Oria' }, location = 'Chateau d\'Oraguille I-9', note = 'Starts Quests:\n* Fit for a Prince\n* Adventurer Appreciation Campaign 2010\n* Her Memories: Grave Resolve\n\nInvolved in Quests:\n* Blackmail\n* Lure of the Wildcat (San d\'Oria)\n* The Holy Crest\n* A Timely Visit\n\nStarts Missions:\n* Aht Urhgan Mission 6: Easterly Winds\n* The Voracious Resurgence: Altennia Burns Bright\n\nInvolved in Missions:\n* San d\'Oria Mission 2-3: Journey Abroad\n* San d\'Oria Mission 3-3: Appointment to Jeuno\n* San d\'Oria Mission 5-1: The Ruins of Fei\'Yin\n* San d\'Oria Mission 8-1: Coming of Age\n* San d\'Oria Mission 9-1: Breaking Barriers\n* Bastok Mission 2-3: The Emissary\n* Windurst Mission 2-3: The Three Kingdoms\n* Aht Urhgan Mission 5: Confessions of Royalty\n* Aht Urhgan Mission 47: The Empress Crowned\n* Wings of the Goddess Mission 28: Another World' },
