    ['Harith'] = { type = 'Quest Giver NPC', zones = { 'Jeuno', 'Ru\'Lude Gardens' }, location = 'Ru\'Lude Gardens H-5, Archduke\'s House', note = 'Starts Quests:\n* Empty Memories\n\nNotes:\n* Harith creates the Animas used to enfeeble the Empty-type monsters in Promyvion. See the Empty Memories Walkthrough or The Mothercrystals for more details.' },
