    ['Hilda'] = { zones = { 'Bastok', 'Port Bastok' }, location = 'Port Bastok E-6, Walks around inside the Steaming Sheep', note = 'Involved in Quests:\n* Lure of the Wildcat (Bastok)\n* Cid\'s Secret\n* The Usual\n* Riding on the Clouds\n\nInvolved in Missions:\n* The Voracious Resurgence #2: The Brygid Cup\n\nNotes:\n* To speak to Hilda while she is on the top floor, get as close to directly beneath her as possible. She will also interact while on the stairs if you stand across from Sawyer at the counter. *Described in Riding on the Clouds as, "A woman who lost her husband in an accident in the Palborough Mines."' },
