    ['Laisavie X Berlends'] = { zones = { 'Battle', 'San d\'Oria (S)', 'Southern San d\'Oria (S)' }, location = 'Southern San d\'Oria (S) J-8', note = 'Notes:\n* Appears during Campaign Battles in Jugner Forest (S) and Southern San d\'Oria (S) as the leader of the Silver Fox Archers. She is a Paladin/Ranger. *Has a unique ranged weaponskill: Arrow of Apathy which deals conal damage and Paralyze to enemies in range. *Uses Invincible. *Casts Protect IV, Shell IV and Cure IV. *Uses Barrage to weaponskill back to back; often uses her battle cry before doing so. *When in melee range may use Sword WS\'s such as Vorpal Blade and Savage Blade *Battle Cry: "This arrow to your heart shall be Altana\'s final judgement."' },
