    ['Liki Steligho'] = { zones = { 'Jeuno', 'Lower Jeuno' }, location = 'Lower Jeuno J-8 in Neptune\'s Spire', note = 'Notes:\nOffers background info on the Treasure Coffer at Tenshodo HQ.' },
    ['Liliroon'] = { type = 'Cutscene NPC', zones = { 'Cutscene', 'Nashmau' }, location = 'Nashmau', note = 'Involved in Quests:\n* Promotion: Sergeant' },
    ['Lilisette'] = { type = 'Mission NPC', zones = { 'Cutscene', 'San d\'Oria (S)' }, note = 'Involved in Missions:\n* WOTG05: While the Cat is Away\n* WOTG06: A Timeswept Butterfly\n* WOTG07: Purple, The New Black\n* WOTG08: In the Name of the Father\n* WOTG09: Dancers in Distress\n* WOTG10: Daughter of a Knight\n* WOTG11: A Spoonful of Sugar\n* WOTG12: Affairs of State\n* WOTG13: Borne by the Wind\n* WOTG14: A Nation on the Brink\n* WOTG15: Crossroads of Time\n* WOTG16: Sandswept Memories\n* WOTG17: Northland Exposure\n* WOTG18: Traitor in the Midst\n* WOTG19: Betrayal at Beaucedine\n* WOTG22: A Sanguinary Prelude\n* WOTG23: Dungeons and Dancers\n* WOTG24: Distorter of Time\n* WOTG25: The Will of the World\n* WOTG26: Fate in Haze\n\nNotes:\n* Known as the "Moonshade Butterfly," Lilisette is the newest dancer of Troupe Mayakov, renowned for her grace and exotic beauty due to mixed Hume and Elvaan heritage. However, she has been pursuing the mysterious being known as Cait Sith...' },
    ['Liloune'] = { zones = { 'Port San d\'Oria', 'San d\'Oria' }, location = 'Port San d\'Oria G-7' },
    ['Limion, R.K.'] = { type = 'Conquest Overseer', zones = { 'San d\'Oria', 'The Sanctuary of Zi\'Tah' }, location = 'The Sanctuary of Zi\'Tah F-5', note = 'Notes:\nAppears, when Li\'Telor is under weekly conquest-control by San d\'Oria. ;Notes for characters only with San d\'Oria as current Allegiance: :*Casts Signet :*Choice of setting Home Point for free :*Recharges Empress Band or Chariot Band :*Accepts Li\'Telor Supplies for finishing Supply Quest ;Notes for characters only without San d\'Oria as current Allegiance: :*Choice of setting Home Point for a fee - higher prices for higher Allegiance Ranks (Rank 10: 5600 gil) For further information see Conquest Overseer.' },
    ['Lin Megomifu'] = { zones = { 'Heavens Tower', 'Windurst' }, location = 'Heavens Tower' },
    ['Lindgard, I.M.'] = { type = 'Conquest Overseer', zones = { 'Eastern Altepa Desert', 'Outland' }, location = 'Eastern Altepa Desert F-10', note = 'Notes:\nAppears, when Kuzotz is under weekly conquest-control by Bastok. ;Notes for characters only with Bastok as current Allegiance: :*Casts Signet :*Choice of setting Home Point for free :*Recharges Emperor Band, Empress Band or Chariot Band :*Accepts Kuzotz Supplies for finishing Supply Quest :*Accepts Garrison starting item Dhalmel Leather Missive ;Notes for characters only without Bastok as current Allegiance: :*Choice of setting Home Point for a fee - higher prices for higher Allegiance Ranks (Rank 10: 5600 gil) For further information see Conquest Overseer.' },
    ['Lined Casket'] = { type = 'Cruor Merchant', zones = { '*Abyssea - Konschtat' }, location = '*Abyssea - Konschtat (G-5) *Abyssea - Altepa (G-8)', note = 'Involved in Quests:\n* Help Not Wanted' },
    ['Linkshell Concierge'] = { type = 'Linkpearl Distribution NPCs', zones = { 'Bastok', 'San d\'Oria', 'See below', 'Windurst' }, location = 'See below', note = 'Notes:\nLinkshell Concierges serve to distribute Linkpearls to players wishing to join recruiting Linkshells.' },
    ['Linus'] = { type = 'Chocobobet Center Clerk', zones = { 'Chocobo Circuit' }, location = 'Chocobo Circuit I-9, Windurst Area', note = 'Notes:\n* Takes bets for the chocobo races.' },
    ['Linzaza'] = { type = 'Cutscene NPC', zones = { 'Cutscene', 'Various Cutscenes' }, location = 'Various Cutscenes', note = 'Involved in Quests:\n* As Thick as Thieves\n* Hitting the Marquisate\n\nNotes:\nMember of Atarefaunet\'s Band' },
    ['Lion'] = { type = 'Mission NPC', zones = { 'Cut scenes only', 'Cutscene', 'Norg' }, location = 'Cut scenes only', note = 'Involved in Quests:\n* Apocalypse Nigh\n\nInvolved in Missions:\n* San d\'Oria Mission 2-3: Journey Abroad\n* Bastok Mission 2-3: The Emissary\n* Windurst Mission 2-3: The Three Kingdoms\n* San d\'Oria Mission 4-1: Magicite\n* Bastok Mission 4-1: Magicite\n* Windurst Mission 4-1: Magicite\n* San d\'Oria Mission 5-1: The Ruins of Fei\'Yin\n* Bastok Mission 5-1: Darkness Rising\n* Windurst Mission 5-1: The Final Seal\n* San d\'Oria Mission 5-2: The Shadow Lord\n* Bastok Mission 5-2: Xarcabard, Land of Truths\n* Windurst Mission 5-2: The Shadow Awaits\n* Zilart Mission 1: The New Frontier\n* Zilart Mission 2: Welcome t\'Norg\n* Zilart Mission 8: Return to Delkfutt\'s Tower\n* Zilart Mission 9: Ro\'Maeve\n* Zilart Mission 16: The Celestial Nexus\n* Rhapsodies Mission 1-2-1: The Path Untraveled\n* Rhapsodies Mission 1-2-5: A Land After Time\n* Rhapsodies Mission 3-1-33: Absolute Trust\n* Rhapsodies Mission 3-1-35: A Rhapsody for the Ages\n\nNotes:\nA young woman from the pirate cove of Norg, sent by her father Gilgamesh to investigate the activities of the beastmen and the Grand Duchy.' },
