    ['Mathilde'] = { zones = { 'Selbina' }, location = 'Selbina H-9', note = 'Involved in Quests:\n* Riding on the Clouds\n\nInvolved in Missions:\n* Promathia Mission 6-3: More Questions than Answers\n* Those Who Lurk in Shadows (III)\n* Remember Me in Your Dreams\n\nNotes:\n*  Triggers the cutscene titled "Aldo" when first spoken to. * She was adopted and her real parents were taken by beastmen. * Her grandmother (Ramona) said that she lost her memory. * Appears in A Crystalline Prophecy. * Described in Riding on the Clouds as, "A weaving woman who lost her memory in Selbina."' },
