    ['Pieuje'] = { type = 'Cutscene NPC', zones = { 'Cutscene', 'Cutscenes, Chateau d\'Oraguille', 'San d\'Oria' }, location = 'Cutscenes, Chateau d\'Oraguille (H-8) Door: Prince Regent\'s Rm', note = 'Starts Quests:\n* Pieuje\'s Decision\n* Prelude of Black and White\n\nInvolved in Missions:\n* San d\'Oria Mission 5-2: The Shadow Lord\n* San d\'Oria Mission 9-2: The Heir to the Light\n* Aht Urhgan Mission 5: Confessions of Royalty\n* A Crystalline Prophecy (Mission)\n\nNotes:\nThe prince can only be seen when on a quest/mission, or starting a quest/mission involving him. (H-8) is the location of the door to his room. Pieuje is the younger son of King Destin. He and his brother Trion are fierce rivals, and will disagree on almost anything. His sister is Claidie.' },
