    ['Trust: Sakura'] = { zones = { 'Battle' }, note = 'Notes:\n* Produces an invisible aura which gradually restores HP and increases combat skill gain rate.[http://forum.square-enix.com/ffxi/threads/40822-Freshly-Picked-Vana%E2%80%99diel-5-Digest?s=f2ff1d0a8d450cd90e484f7aedf72e52&p=499745#post499745 "Freshly Picked Vana?diel 5" Digest] It is described as a Geomancy effect. *The aura affects all party members, including other summoned Alter Egos, but does not affect Adventuring Fellows. *The Regen effect stacks with all other forms of Regen (Status Effect), even a player-generated Indi-Regen effect. *Regen potency is affected by level: :*Level 1-25: 1 HP/tick :*Level 26-51: 2 HP/tick :*Level 52-73: 3 HP/tick :*Level 74-87: 4 HP/tick :*Level 88-98: 5 HP/tick :*Level 99: 6 HP/tick *Player stats and Item Level do not appear to affect the potency of the Regen effect.{{verification' },
