    ['Wahboud'] = { zones = { 'Al Zahbi', 'Cutscene' }, note = 'Involved in Quests:\n* Give Peace a Chance\n* Three Men and a Closet\n\nNotes:\n* Friends with Bashraf and Foudeel; the three are seen during the Three Men and a Closet quest cutscenes. *Appears during the Sunbreeze Festival event Fantastic Fraulein Mumor 2010 to heckle Mumor and Uka. *If you are raising a chocobo, starting at the adolescent stage you will meet them on a walk in Tahrongi Canyon, La Theine Plateau, or Konschtat Highlands where they are raising a chocobo together. They will challenge you to a friendly competition. *There is a chance that he will jockey for their chocobo during official races. If he does, Sakura will comment about how he makes up for his lack of brains with a supply of pepper biscuits.' },
